    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67690" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῑκῐχιζόμενος</span></b> , 
			Lacon.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μικκιχιδδόμενος</span></b> , in athletic
		contests at Sparta, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>boy under
				age,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				5(1).285
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ μικιχιζομένων μέχρι
				μελλειρονείας</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				296
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μικιζόμενος</span></b>  is
			expld. as <i>a male child in his third year</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λέξεις Ἡροδότου</span> in Stein <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> ii <i><span class="en">
				p.465
			</span></i> (Berol.<i><span class="en">
				1871
			</span></i>).</div>
